ungen sind hochgradig anpassbar und k\u00f6nnen f\u00fcr eigene Projekte genutzt werden.", "short_description": "Artivact ist ein kostenloses, quelloffenes Werkzeug zur Sammlungsverwaltung und -pr\u00e4sentation.\nMit Artivact XR kannst du diese Sammlungen in der virtuellen Realit\u00e4t erleben."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "quest_portrait.png", "id": "4209759382644599", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393841_4209759385977932_3266183942185304833_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7EGOU2cuvxcQ7kNvwHd27vK&_nc_oc=AdoVV8uwI5BsxzZguCZA6lXYbsuy7nbfSoQqqnifojNk8eSgGCuRQmNNKg9E9amYthM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5ZiW23L5DquqIn1OUW9mvMhtWrb-R5_PDl1oLvh_n68g&oe=6A20467C"}, {"file_name": "quest_hero_cover.png", "id": "1263316755151138", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499292244_1263316758484471_159357681156275043_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2fzn4XI9ldMQ7kNvwGlS20A&_nc_oc=AdpZTOqitDbhfCDdCQ2O6YyKQVTtgocsbs-_0oCuZ6p_RVPoBQCq5BEdHmRGIM2GWZ0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4UJMfXLmSwX0I48Jv8ixuXJLwOOhWw_nY2e1ySDSbgng&oe=6A202A96"}, {"file_name": "quest_landscape.png", "id": "1039024501005104", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393450_1039024504338437_7487200977707356540_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mXtpp8jrYfAQ7kNvwFIErlq&_nc_oc=Adq9kl2B0yOtrrhFC-aPPzYlClx_mmf0MQ1LhzL4dm-Ew_P26yPPOHKw047gL4rpgSs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7mMDt4ao-NFMh6VZL9b1-aHQ-u02oH_4OftTzv1zz-fQ&oe=6A203864"}, {"file_name": "quest_logo.png", "id": "707346191636121", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499302233_707346198302787_7894586970020286030_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_